## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design robust, scalable data quality controls in a multi-tenant streaming pipeline, including schema evolution, late data handling, and quarantine workflows.

## Key Concepts

- Data quality gates and quarantines
- Per-tenant schema versions and defaults
- Idempotent writes and deduplication
- Backfill strategies and replay
- Observability with OpenTelemetry and CloudWatch

## Code Example

